        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1848, 3-1/2 x 4-3/4 Stainless Flush Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stainless steel flush cup pulls can be used for residential or commercial doors. Durable and sturdy for many years of everyday use. For use with sliding door, swinging doors or pocket doors. No screws used for a clean finished installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1848_size.gif?v=1704354505\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1848 Stainless Flush Cup Pull  size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe cup pull is slightly offset for easier grasp. They will fit back to back on a 1-3/8\" thick sliding pocket door. They are pressure mounted into the doors face (no screws).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1848-630 Stainless Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 16 Gauge (.060\")</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  630 Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1848.pdf?v=1704262238\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1848 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
